sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RO as Research-Orchestrator
    participant HS as Historical-Stats
    participant CR as Context-Research
    participant API as College Basketball API
    participant MCP as MCP Tools (Brave, Fetch, Deep Research)
    participant PV as Pydantic Validator
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant EMB as qwen3-embedding:8b
    participant VDB as ChromaDB

    Note over RO,VDB: One-time background ingestion (not user-initiated)

    loop For each batch of historical game IDs
        RO->>RO: Decompose and assign game IDs
        par Historical statistical research
            RO->>HS: Assign game IDs
            HS->>API: Request box scores and game statistics
            API-->>HS: Return historical statistics
            HS-->>RO: Return structured game records
        and Historical contextual research
            RO->>CR: Assign game IDs
            CR->>MCP: Brave Search: find reports and news
            MCP-->>CR: Return search results
            CR->>MCP: Fetch: retrieve source documents
            MCP-->>CR: Return source content
            CR->>MCP: Deep Research: investigate game context
            MCP-->>CR: Return research evidence
            CR-->>RO: Return documents, citations, and context
        end
    end

    RO->>RO: Aggregate records and join by game ID
    RO->>PV: Validate aggregated JSON records

    alt Validation successful
        PV-->>RO: Validated structured records
        RO->>DB: Store validated game JSON
        DB-->>RO: Confirm storage
        RO->>RO: Chunk cited source documents
        RO->>EMB: Generate chunk embeddings
        EMB-->>RO: Return embedding vectors
        RO->>VDB: Store chunks, vectors, and metadata
        VDB-->>RO: Confirm ingestion complete
    else Validation failed
        PV-->>RO: Return schema and field errors
        RO->>RO: Log validation failures
        RO->>DB: Quarantine invalid records and error details
        DB-->>RO: Confirm quarantine
    end
